    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after one of your **VANGUARD INVADER** units selects its targets, on that unit. Pick 1 enemy unit it targeted with at least one attack; that enemy unit must test for [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).\n\nFor the rest of the phase, attacks by models in your unit against that enemy unit get +1 to their [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), and also +1 to their [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) if the test was failed.",
